survey morgannwg

# Station Equivalences
# The morgannwg passage survey overlaps the gilwern passage survey slightly.
# This is the reason for two tie-in points. I felt that it was useful to keep both
# sets of data in the survey because the passage width is shown up.

# *Equate 36 Gilwern.South	; This may not be the precise tie-in point.

# Specify units of measurement

# Magnetic North to Grid North correction
